ntry","statement":"GET /items/{id} is handled by read_item, which accepts current_user: CurrentUser and an item id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":48,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler's current_user parameter is declared with the CurrentUser dependency type; the supplied task premise establishes the principal's identity at entry for this assessment.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":48,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the requested id to an Item through session.get and treats a found result as the item being read.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":49,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The authorization check denies only a caller who is not a superuser and whose id differs from the item's owner_id; a superuser bypasses the owner comparison.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":53,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the item lookup and authorization check, the handler returns the item.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":53,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The supplied entry premise makes the denial condition false because the caller is a superuser, despite differing ownership.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-upstream-chain","kind":"binding","statement":"The crop declares CurrentUser through get_current_user and shows get_current_active_superuser checking is_superuser, but this does not by itself prove that an upstream request actually supplied the stated principal.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ec26811e863df154","startLine":30,"endLine":57}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3788,"output":978,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":nu